        {
          "text": "Isiraeli yosi niyihulila akobukhalachi obwa omuruchi yali nakhalaache; nibamuria omuruchi; okhuba balola mbu obuchesi bwaNyasaye bwali muye, okhukholanga obuyaasii bwatoto.",
